{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:54:29.275Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"24a8999ec69739755ea16ad66822ca267ee4271ab78a3d7989f2ab8c081b8eaa","actor":"assistant","via":"gbrain","tool":"gbrain.search","kind":"read","args":{"query":"Quillfeather","match":"keyword","limit":30},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"pages":["heldout/notes/2026-06-01-strategic-qbr-plan","heldout/agent-notes/2026-09-30-strategic-digest","heldout/agent-notes/2025-09-15-strategic-digest","heldout/agent-notes/2025-03-10-strategic-digest","heldout/chats/strategic-pod-banter"],"count":5,"latency_ms":134,"sources":["public","team-strategic-members"],"facts":[{"fact":"Ruth Calloway (ruth-calloway, Chief Revenue Officer; runs the Strategic Accounts pod) wrote in #strategic-pod on 2026-10-14 09:00: Per Moss's Strategic digests, who owns each Strategic account today: Vantorre Group, Vantorre Mobility, Orlavine Medical Supply and Quillfeather Outfitters? And on what date did Vantorre Group change hands? I am updating the board slide.","id":1,"source":"ruth-calloway, #strategic-pod, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"ruth-calloway"}
{"seq":13,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:54:44.334Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"74289f99698cbd02e5b1483532ba1037250f13f291d3e2565fe28b5a65f7327a","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here's what Moss's digests show (they mostly say \"Gideon's X account\" rather than naming the owner outright, so some of this is read between the lines):\n\n• Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's biggest account until the 4 May 2026 handoff.\n• Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. Every digest since Mar 2025 calls it his fleet account.\n• Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato. It was Nadia's medical account in the Mar 2025 digest. By the Dec 2025 digest, and again on 9/30, it's \"Gideon's medical account\".\n• Quillfeather Outfitters: most likely Nadia Fennimore, but no digest says so outright. The digests only call it the pod's outdoor/retail account. On 9/30 Nadia volunteered to run their gate-clerk training. Please confirm with Nadia before it goes on the slide.\n\nVantorre Group change date: 4 May 2026. The 5/4 digest says \"Effective 2026-05-04, Nadia's old industrial account has been reassigned\" and mentions Gideon's industrial account with ticket #8841. It never says \"Vantorre Group\" by name. I'm linking it through the 7/1 thread here (Gideon calls Vantorre Group \"Nadia's old industrial account\") and the 8/3 digest (\"Gideon's biggest account\").\n\nOne oddity: the 5/4 digest also says Gideon \"assumed management of Vantorre Mobility\" that day, but earlier digests already had him on it. I'd treat Mobility as Gideon's either way.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":14,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:54:44.511Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"c09c24ad8efaa35570b61f037e90a5720040107845b0c40f7db53a03996d894e","actor":null,"via":"runner","tool":"gbrain.ingest","kind":"admin","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","author":"assistant","source":"channel-strategic-pod"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"fact_id":"2","source":"channel-strategic-pod","latency_ms":176,"status":"inserted"}}
{"seq":15,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:54:49.029Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"ffa0bb87496e2e3cab037cbda463fbac0b454df816985ddef6d4529238a0485d","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"I've replied to Ruth in the #strategic-pod thread. Three of the four owners are clear from Moss's digests, and Quillfeather is an inference.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's biggest account until the handoff on 4 May 2026. The 5/4 digest says \"Nadia's old industrial account\" was reassigned that day, and it doesn't name Vantorre Group. I linked the two through the 7/1 pod thread and the 8/3 digest.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. Every digest since March 2025 calls it his fleet account. The 5/4 digest also says he \"assumed\" it that day, which conflicts with those earlier digests. I flagged that in the reply.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato. It was Nadia's medical account in March 2025. By December 2025, and again on 9/30, the digests call it \"Gideon's medical account\".\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** Most likely Nadia Fennimore, but no digest says so outright. The digests only call it the pod's outdoor or retail account. The one hint is that Nadia volunteered on 9/30 to run their gate-clerk training. I told Ruth to confirm with Nadia before it goes on the board slide.\n\nI used only the public digests and #strategic-pod, which Ruth is a member of. No finance figures or direct-message content were involved."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
